<rml>
<head>
	<title>Character Creation</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="charsel_frame.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="char_make.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="char_make">
	<!-- rml-contract-optional-callback: charmake_select_job: the 0.97k panel picks the class with its arrows (charmake_class_arrow), not class buttons -->
	<!-- The 0.97k New Character panel (Scene_CharSelect, its create states): the class's face in
	     the frame under the title, the name line under it, the class line with its two arrows
	     (each pressed while clicked, blacked out with no class to step to on that side; the row
	     under them only presses, as in the 0.97k client), and Cancel and OK at the foot, lit under
	     the pointer. The panel drops in from the top each time it opens (#box.open). Its other
	     boxes stay empty, as the 0.97k client left them. The dragon frame is drawn again over the
	     panel, as the 0.97k client drew it over everything.
	     #panel (which CharMakeWin.cpp places) stays in the flow and takes no position; the theme
	     places #box on the 0.97k screen. Same ids, model and event names as char_make.rml; the
	     class buttons, stats and description, which the 0.97k panel had none of, are left out. -->
	<div id="backdrop"></div>
	<div id="panel">
		<div id="box" class="classic-font-text" data-class-open="open">
			<div id="box_top"></div>
			<div id="box_bottom"></div>

			<img id="preview" class="awaiting-frame"/>

			<input id="char_name" type="text" class="text-field char-make-name-field classic-font-text"
			       data-value="char_name" autofocus/>

			<div id="class_line"><span id="class_name">{{desc_title}}</span></div>
			<div id="arrow_prev" class="arrow" data-class-disabled="prev_class_disabled"
			     data-event-click="charmake_class_arrow(-1)"></div>
			<div id="arrow_next" class="arrow" data-class-disabled="next_class_disabled"
			     data-event-click="charmake_class_arrow(1)"></div>
			<div id="arrow_prev_low" class="arrow"></div>
			<div id="arrow_next_low" class="arrow"></div>

			<div id="btn_cancel" class="btn97" data-event-click="charmake_cancel_click"></div>
			<div id="btn_ok" class="btn97" data-event-click="charmake_ok_click"></div>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div id="frame">
		<div id="frame_top_left" class="frame-piece"></div>
		<div id="frame_top_right" class="frame-piece"></div>
		<div id="frame_side_left_top" class="frame-piece"></div>
		<div id="frame_side_right_top" class="frame-piece"></div>
		<div id="frame_side_left_bottom" class="frame-piece"></div>
		<div id="frame_side_right_bottom" class="frame-piece"></div>
		<div id="frame_bottom_left" class="frame-piece"></div>
		<div id="frame_bottom_right" class="frame-piece"></div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
